      "q": "How much does Leidos make from federal contracts?",
      "a": "Leidos has federal contract obligations of $2B for FY2026 to date. Leidos recorded 2,777 awards with an average award size of $730K, and obligations fell 33.3% year over year. Historical annual obligations include FY21 at $1.9B, FY22 at $2.7B, FY23 at $2.6B, FY24 at $3B, and FY25 at $3B."
